<title>USA: Developers Diversified acquires Minn. mall.</title>
<headline>Developers Diversified acquires Minn. mall.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Developers Diversified Realty Corp said Thursday it completed the acquisition of an initial portion of a new shopping center in Minneapolis, Minn.</p>
<p>Developers Diversified said it paid about $20.3 million for the portion from an affiliate of  Opus Corp. The price could go up to $31.8 million, upon completion of the mall, it said.</p>
<p>The mall has 271,000 square feet, of which 92,000 square feet remains to be completed in the next several months, it said.</p>
</text>
